      "field": "description",
      "before": "<p>The<b> Nauratan Rani Pearl Drop Necklace Set </b>comes with a unique design that has been fashioned on a silver finish. With sparkling stones complemented with an architectural design and crystal drop detailing, this necklace set can be worn on weddings and grand celebrations as well as any other evening occasions. The jewelry set is an elegant choice with its heritage style and multilayered symmetrical design.</p>\n<p><b>Features:</b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li>\n<b>Type:</b> Festive Statement Necklace Set / Bridal Choker &amp; Chandelier Jhumka Set</li>\n<li>\n<b>Material:</b> Premium Alloy with a Luxurious Silver Finish, Shimmering Clear Stones, and Delicate Faux Pearls</li>\n<li>\n<b>Design:</b> High-fashion heritage layout featuring a dual-strand delicate necklace woven with micro-pave geometric links and hanging pearl seed drops, complete with an adjustable white thread tassel cord; paired with massive, majestic teardrop-shaped statement earrings featuring intricate silver filigree, multi-strand pearl bead suspensions, and dangling mini jhumka drops</li>\n<li>\n<b>Aesthetic:</b> Radiant, Bold, and Sophisticated with Royal Heritage Charm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Necklace Length: </b>7 inches</li>\n<li>\n<b>Earrings Length: </b>2.5 inches</li>\n<li>\n<b>Total Weight: </b>180 grams</li>\n<li>\n<b>What's in the Box:</b> 1 x Necklace, 1 Pair of Heavy Chandelier Jhumka Earrings</li>\n<li>\n<b>Packaging:</b> Elegantly Packaged in Zeesy Jewellery Signature Box</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Care Instructions:</b> To maintain the beautiful shine of your jewelry, gently wipe it with a soft cloth after each wear. Avoid contact with water, harsh chemicals, or excessive moisture to preserve the piece's function and plating.</p>\n<p><b>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</b></p>\n<p><b>Q1: Is this Nauratan Necklace-0513 set suitable for a festive wedding look?</b></p>\n<p><b>A:</b> Yes, the elaborate heritage craftsmanship, majestic multi-piece layered arrangement, and shimmering stone accents make it a regal choice for modern brides, bridesmaids, or heavy traditional wedding layouts like Barat, Mehndi, and Reception events.</p>\n<p><b>Q2: What outfit styles pair best with this traditional silver chandelier jhumka necklace set?</b></p>\n<p><b>A:</b> It pairs exquisitely with heavy embroidered banarasi sarees, festive ghararas, bridal lehengas, and rich velvet pishwas. The striking combination of fine double-layer chains and prominent multi-drop statement earrings creates a spectacular look that elevates premium traditional ensembles.</p>\n<p><b>Q3: Is the material used in this necklace set skin-friendly for long wedding festivities?</b></p>\n<p><b>A:</b> Our jewelry is crafted from premium high-grade alloy with a smooth silver finish, designed to be lightweight, soft, and comfortable for sensitive skin during long traditional celebrations.</p>\n<p><b>Q4: How does this specific Nauratan style elevate my fashion status at events?</b></p>\n<p><b>A:</b> The combination of a majestic stacked architecture, central botanical crystal plaques, and luxurious textured geometric frames is a true symbol of grand luxury and heritage fashion taste. Wearing this trend/style status statement piece instantly adds a touch of elite sophistication and traditional grace to your overall style.</p>\n<p><b>Q5: What is the delivery time and authenticity guarantee?</b></p>\n<p><b>A:</b> Delivery across Pakistan takes 3–7 working days after order confirmation. Every Zeesy piece is quality-checked to ensure premium craftsmanship and brand authenticity.</p>\n<p><b>Also known as:</b> haar | necklace set | gulu band | choker | silver necklace | heavy jhumkay | wedding jewelry | bridal set | pearl necklace | long earrings | traditional zaivar | statement jewelry | Pakistani wedding jewellery | artificial set | kundan jhumka</p>",
      "after": "<p>The <strong>Nauratan Rani Pearl Drop Necklace Set</strong> pairs a traditional double-strand faux pearl necklace with statement chandelier jhumkas. Intricate stone detailing and a silver-tone finish make this artificial pearl jewellery set a distinctive choice for Pakistani weddings, Mehndi, Barat and festive occasions.</p><h2>Traditional Hyderabadi Nauratan jewellery</h2><p>Inspired by the enduring jewellery traditions of Hyderabad Deccan, this artificial pearl necklace set recreates the aesthetic of traditional fine jewellery using decorative stones and faux pearls. Designed for comfortable festive styling according to Zee.Sy, it can be worn by women of any marital status. Individual necklace and earring weights have not been separately verified.</p><p>Discover the heritage and styling ideas in our <a href=\"/blogs/latest/hyderabadi-jewellery-nauratan-necklace-set\">Hyderabadi jewellery guide</a>.</p><p>A returning Zee.Sy bestseller, available in Multi, Red, Pearl and Silver colour options, subject to stock.</p><h2>Product details</h2><ul>\n<li>Material: alloy, decorative stones and faux pearls</li>\n<li>Necklace length: 7 inches</li>\n<li>Earring length: 2.5 inches</li>\n<li>Total set weight: 180 grams</li>\n<li>Adjustable thread fastening</li>\n<li>Includes one necklace and one pair of chandelier jhumka earrings</li>\n<li>Zee.Sy signature box</li>\n</ul><h2>How to style your pearl necklace set</h2><p>Pair this Nauratan necklace with a lehenga, gharara, embroidered saree or pishwas for a traditional wedding look.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Are the pearls real?</h3><p>No. This set features decorative faux pearls.</p><h3>Are earrings included?</h3><p>Yes, one matching pair of chandelier jhumkas is included.</p><h3>Is the necklace adjustable?</h3><p>Yes, it has an adjustable thread fastening.</p><h3>Do you deliver across Pakistan?</h3><p>Yes. Delivery normally takes 3–7 working days after order confirmation. Cash on delivery is available in Pakistan.</p><h2>Jewellery care</h2><p>Wipe gently with a soft dry cloth after wearing. Avoid water, perfume and harsh chemicals, and store separately.</p>"
